---
title: PaymentReceipt State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : staff records total amount collected (Retailer, date, evidence)
    Draft --> Draft : allocate amounts to invoices/orders (Retailer choice or suggested order)
    Draft --> Confirmed : confirm (allocations within receipt amount and outstanding balances, remainder to Unapplied Credit)
    Draft --> Cancelled : discard an unconfirmed receipt
    Confirmed --> Reversed : reversal entry posted, a corrected receipt is created separately
    Confirmed --> [*]
    Reversed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
